<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose nine points to 1,490.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose nine points to 1,490.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,490 today from 1,481 on March 17, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1500    13.614	  1492    13.544</p>
<p>   1a   1490 11286.000	  1474 11163.000</p>
<p>   2    1800    25.714	  1798    25.688</p>
<p>   2a   1840 15093.000	  1826 14975.000</p>
